<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσχιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncloven,</i> of
			solid-hoofed animals, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχιζόπους,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1038a14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not curdled,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philum.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.29.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>undivided,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				36d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερὸν ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					519a28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκτυλοι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				517a32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέψ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				513b13
			</span></i>; of logical division, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				221e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>indivisible by fission,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				385a16
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				386b26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.528
			</span></i>; <i>not liable to split,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				72
			</span></i>.</div>
